      "key": "wiggle-egress",
      "content": {
        "title": "Create files and artifacts",
        "layout": "horizontal",
        "bodyText": "Claude can do more than answer questions. Ask it to build interactive web apps, write documents, generate spreadsheets and presentations, or create visuals in a dedicated window alongside your chat.\n\nIt’s all included on your free plan.\n\nClaude uses limited network access to install packages for file creation. Manage in <a href=\"/settings/capabilities\">Settings</a> or <a href=\"https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/12111783-create-and-edit-files-with-claude\" target=\"_blank\">learn more</a>",
        "badgeText": "New",
        "ctaActions": [
          {
            "text": "Try it out",
            "actions": [
              {
                "id": "enable_wiggle",
                "type": "remote"
              },
              {
                "type": "prompt",
                "value": "Hey Claude, can you make me a PowerPoint about the Golden Gate Bridge?"
              }
            ],
            "isPrimary": true
          }
        ],
        "pictogramName": "ObjectDocumentMultiple",
